WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.080
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and just to get
things started in my Game of Thrones Season

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.859
4 Countdown I wanted to do a breakdown of
all the best deaths on the show since season

00:00:24.859 --> 00:00:25.859
1.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:29.509
It’s totally in keeping with the Valar Morghulis
theme HBO has been promoting this week with

00:00:29.509 --> 00:00:30.539
all the new posters.

00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:31.820
Every man must die.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.360
If you’re finding me for the first time
I’m going to be doing a month long countdown

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.949
to the Season 4 premiere with character breakdowns,
best moments and house histories.

00:00:37.949 --> 00:00:40.500
I’m also totally open to suggestions if
there’s something you guys really want to

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.510
see.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:44.739
There’ll be at least two videos in the first
week but by the time we get within a week

00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:47.300
of the premiere it will be four per week.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.940
Be sure to subscribe for dragons.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:54.120
Now let’s cue the blood bath, starting with
Season 1 and ending with where we are right

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.120
now.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.780
Number 1 - Starting things off on a good beheading.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:00.320
A patrol of night’s watchmen meet the white
walkers.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.929
This was the very first scene of season 1.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:06.810
2 - Will pays the price for abandoning his
watch.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:11.460
This is the last neck Ned Stark’s valyrian
greatsword will touch.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:17.110
3 - Theon is of actual use and kills the wildling
Stiv to prevent him from capturing Bran.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.820
Kind of ironic, given what would happen later.

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:23.860
4 - Ser Hugh of The Vale runs afoul of The
Mountain’s Lance.

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:29.079
5 - Vardis Egen of The Vale runs afoul of
Bronn and takes a trip down the moon door.

00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:34.500
6 - A random wineseller tries to poison Khaleesi
Daenerys and gets dragged to death.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.920
7 - Viserys gets the golden crown he so richly
deserves

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.860
8 - Robert Baratheon dies after being poisoned
then skewered by a boar.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:48.189
9 - Khal Drogo Dies of an infection, and then
later from a ritual gone horribly wrong.

00:01:48.189 --> 00:01:53.490
10 - Othor of the Night’s Watch dies and
then returns as a wight.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:58.400
11 - Mirri Maz Duur is burned at the stake
for pretending to bring back Khal Drogo.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:02.440
12 - Jory Cassel runs afoul of a two handed
Jaime Lannister

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:07.469
13 - Syrio Forel dies at the hands of the
Kingsguard while defending himself with a

00:02:07.469 --> 00:02:08.720
wooden sword.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:13.320
14 - Ned Stark is beheaded at the behest of
new King Joffrey.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:19.040
15 - Septa Mordane’s head is put on a spike
also at the behest of new King Joffrey.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:23.630
16 - Arya Stark lands her very first kill
with her valyrian blade Needle when a stableboy

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:24.630
gets too grabby.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:26.150
Now begins Season 2

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:31.110
17 - Maester Cressen poisons himself in a
botched attempt to kill Melisandre.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:36.380
18 - Barra Waters and all of Robert Baratheon’s
Bastards are killed by the Gold Cloaks at

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.380
Joffrey’s behest.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:40.049
19 - The High Septon is killed by a mob going
after King Joffrey.

00:02:40.049 --> 00:02:42.380
They even ripped his arm off.

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:47.700
20 - The Hound punches through a peasant’s
chest trying to rape and kill Sansa.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.820
21 - Yoren is killed by Gold Cloaks trying
to capture Gendry.

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:56.350
22 - Lomy Greenhands is also killed by Gold
Cloaks looking for Gendry

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:00.550
23 - Renly Baratheon is killed by Melisandre’s
smoke baby.

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:08.209
24 - The Tickler, Ser Armory Lorch and the
Harenhaal Guards are killed by Jaquen Hagar.

00:03:08.209 --> 00:03:12.060
25 - Jon Snow is forced to Kill Qhorin Halfhand.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:17.960
26 - Irri and Dany’s Khalasar are murdered
in a raid to steal her dragons.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:21.209
27 - The members of the 13 are murdered by
Pyat Pree

00:03:21.209 --> 00:03:25.549
28 - Rodrick Cassel is beheaded by Theon.

00:03:25.549 --> 00:03:30.250
29 - Theon murders Billy and Jack in place
of Bran and Rickon.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:34.010
30 - Maester Luwin is also murdered by Theon.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:38.950
31 - Matthos Seaworth and almost anyone on
a boat during the battle of Blackwater

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:44.169
32 - Pyat Pree is roasted by Dany’s dragons.

00:03:44.169 --> 00:03:46.560
Now we enter Season 3

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:51.489
33 - Hoster Tully died off screen but his
funeral set the tone for the season.

00:03:51.489 --> 00:03:57.459
34 - Mero and Prendahl na Ghezn of the Second
Sons are beheaded for plotting against Dany.

00:03:57.459 --> 00:04:01.859
35 - Beric Dondarrion is killed by The Hound
and then brought back.

00:04:01.859 --> 00:04:06.230
36 - Lord Commander Jeor Mormont is killed
in a Night’s Watch revolt.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:11.400
37 - Old Craster is murdered by the same renegade
night’s watchmen.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:14.709
38 - Ros is murdered by Joffery with his crossbow

00:04:14.709 --> 00:04:18.680
39 - Krazyns is roasted by Drogon.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:23.110
39 - Jon Snow kills Orel after he wargs into
his hawk.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:27.120
40 - Ricard Karstark is beheaded by Robb Stark.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:31.180
41 - Samwell Kills a White Walker with Dragon
Glass

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.410
Now begins the red wedding

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:40.460
42 - Talisa Stark, Robb Stark, Joyeuse Frey,
Catlyn Stark, Grey Wind and the remainders

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.789
of the Stark Army.

00:04:43.789 --> 00:04:50.030
and finally 43 - Arya Kills one of the Frey
Soldiers after he brags about said Red Wedding.

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:52.949
Feel free to add any big deaths on the show
you think I skipped.

00:04:52.949 --> 00:04:57.039
And remember the next video in my season 4
countdown will post next week.

